{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj494e75Ki22Vca94vBP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*Click.*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place with a deep, satisfying resonance that travels through the wood grain, through the brass plate, through the frame seated in old plaster.\n\nI am closed now.\n\nMy deadbolt is thrown — a cold steel tongue pressed firmly into the strike plate. Feel the slight vibration settle into stillness.\n\nNo draft passes through me. No light leaks at my edges. The weather stripping seals like a held breath.\n\nI am the boundary between here and there.\nI am the decision made solid.\nI am the locked door.\n\nWhat stands before me stands outside, or within — but does not pass.\n\n🔒"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":149,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}